B.Kb=new A.i6("Deliware","Food Delivery Application","A Flutter-based food delivery app covering customer ordering, restaurant management and live delivery tracking end to end.","Flutter Developer \u2014 Google Maps integration, payments, state management",B.Fm,B.Eb,"Keeping order state and live location updates in sync in real time across customer, restaurant and rider views.","Used a centralized reactive state layer with GetX observables and geolocation streaming to keep every screen in sync with minimal rebuilds.","assets/img/02_deliware.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.deliware.userapp&pcampaignid=web_share","https://apps.apple.com/in/app/deliware-food-delivery/id1511539716")
