B.K9=new A.i6("Delivery Rider","Rider Companion App","A dedicated rider-side application for live order tracking, route navigation, ETA calculation and end-to-end order workflow management.","Flutter Developer \u2014 rider workflow, live tracking, navigation",B.G5,B.FF,"Refactoring a monolithic rider signup flow into a maintainable structure while chasing down layout crashes under scroll.","Split the signup screen into a clean GetX controller/view architecture and resolved layout constraints so the flow renders reliably across devices.","assets/img/03_delivery_rider.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.deliware.delicartdelivery&pcampaignid=web_share","https://apps.apple.com/in/app/delicart-partner/id1519923845")
