B.Kc=new A.i6("Restaurant Admin","Order, Menu & Inventory Console","A Flutter-based admin application for Android phones, tablets, iPhone and iPad, giving restaurants a single console for orders, menus, inventory and operations.","Flutter Developer \u2014 responsive multi-device layout, analytics dashboard",B.lB,B.F5,"One codebase needed to feel native across four very different screen sizes and input modes.","Built adaptive layout breakpoints and reusable widget components so the same screens reflow cleanly from phone to tablet to iPad.","assets/img/04_restaurant_admin.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.delicart.orders&pcampaignid=web_share","https://apps.apple.com/in/app/delicart-orders/id6447287739")
